      "text" : "Nope.",
      "translation" : "不感兴趣"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Guide of field of fight",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[SongHeeYeon]\nJust like the name of this place,\nit is a field for matches.\nWe have various monsters\nin different levels.",
      "translation" : "[宋熙妍]\n正如这个地方的名字一样，\n这里是进行比赛的场地。\n这里有各种不同等级的魔物。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Guide of field of fight",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[SongHeeYeon]\n1st Class Boss Monsters are in middle of preparation yet.\nWe charge you a small fee to enter here.",
      "translation" : "[宋熙妍]\n1级Boss魔物还在准备中。\n进入这里需要收取少量费用。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Guide of field of fight",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[SongHeeYeon]\nEh.... excuse me?\nAh, I'm afraid I have to work right now...\nSorry...",
      "translation" : "[宋熙妍]\n呃...抱歉？\n啊，我现在恐怕得工作了...\n对不起..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Guide of field of fight",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[SongHeeYeon]\nYes, thank you.\nHave a good time.",
      "translation" : "[宋熙妍]\n好的，谢谢。\n祝您玩得愉快。"
    },
    {
